# AI tooling local config (keep local, not for deployment)
# Root-level instruction files (CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / GEMINI.md) ARE tracked —
# they describe the project. Only the tool-specific config dirs stay local.
.claude/*
!.claude/project.json
.gemini/
.codex/
.kimi/
.opencode/

